    "steam_appid": 3332030,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332030/extras/e2d107f34a9204ec7f377432dfb0b718.avif?t=1746365809\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become an Adventurer on an epic journey through a vibrant digital world, where learning Python is the key to unlocking new realms. Dodge obstacles, solve logic puzzles, and harness coding powers to outsmart enemies in this adventure-packed platformer. With every step, you will grow closer to mastering the code and unveiling the mysteries of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An epic journey of discovery</strong> where coding meets creativity in a single-player adventure full of humor and heart.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into handcrafted levels</strong> packed with Python-themed challenges, pushing your problem-solving and platforming skills to the limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master tricky puzzles and uncover secrets</strong>, all while learning the magic of coding in an interactive and memorable way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet a delightful cast of characters</strong>, each bringing their unique personality to guide and entertain you on your quest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging mechanics that blend gameplay with coding</strong>, from unlocking gates to lighting torches, ensuring every challenge feels rewarding.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332030/extras/e2d107f34a9204ec7f377432dfb0b718.avif?t=1746365809\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become an Adventurer on an epic journey through a vibrant digital world, where learning Python is the key to unlocking new realms. Dodge obstacles, solve logic puzzles, and harness coding powers to outsmart enemies in this adventure-packed platformer. With every step, you will grow closer to mastering the code and unveiling the mysteries of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An epic journey of discovery</strong> where coding meets creativity in a single-player adventure full of humor and heart.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into handcrafted levels</strong> packed with Python-themed challenges, pushing your problem-solving and platforming skills to the limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master tricky puzzles and uncover secrets</strong>, all while learning the magic of coding in an interactive and memorable way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet a delightful cast of characters</strong>, each bringing their unique personality to guide and entertain you on your quest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging mechanics that blend gameplay with coding</strong>, from unlocking gates to lighting torches, ensuring every challenge feels rewarding.</p></li></ul>",
